# Workspace identity — App

This folder is **Radiabase_mobile**, the Expo (React Native) app. The backend is **sunnected_jose** (NestJS), a separate GitHub repo next to this one.

- Keep app / Expo rules and React Native code here.
- Do not add NestJS modules, DTOs, Drizzle/ORM, or API server files to this repo.
- Ignore Next.js, React Server Components, Tailwind, and Shadcn guidance while editing this folder. This app uses Expo Router, React Native, Zustand, and TanStack Query.
- Do not merge git histories, use submodules, or create a monorepo.
- Two folders, two `git status`, two PRs.
- Prefer Local Agent in the multi-root workspace. Cloud Agents and git worktrees do not work well with two roots.
- If the user only @-mentions this folder, do not edit the API.
